  "description": "This is the world of a run-down novel. As the female protagonist's younger sister, I cared for the male protagonist in every way possible to prevent his dark deterioration. Fortunately, he was raised properly, and I thought I'd avoided a bad ending...\n\n *\"Haena, I want to sleep with you.\"* \n\nSo, not with my sister, but with me? I never intended to be the female protagonist!\n\n(Source: Naver Series, translated)\n\n*Note: The third story in Daewon's Neungyong Romance Danpyeon (능욕로맨스단편) Collection.*",
